DSH Safekeep is an independent, unofficial community project.
It is not affiliated with, reviewed by, or endorsed by DeepSeek.
DeepSeek Harness is a separate project: https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness

This distribution contains the project's recovery/command-analysis code and
DSH adapter. It does not bundle DeepSeek Harness, Cordis, PowerShell, Node.js,
or third-party community plugin source. There are no third-party Node runtime
dependencies. Development tests install DeepSeek Harness and its dependencies
separately; their own licenses continue to apply to those installations.

The DSH public tool/pre-execute/guard and profile-bundle interfaces informed
the adapter. Related community approaches researched include dsh-safety,
dsh-safe-delete, dsh-file-undo, dsh-safety-net, dsh-security-guard and dsh-riskproof.
They are independent projects, not dependencies or endorsements. No code from
them was intentionally incorporated into this distribution. See
docs/PROVENANCE.md for source traceability and its limits.

